    56→        title: JSON Output Mode
    57→        type: requirement
    58→        status:
    59→          maturity: draft
    60→          implementation: not_started
    61→        description: |
    62→          All commands support --json flag for structured output:
    63→
    64→          kspec tasks ready --json
    65→          kspec item get @login --json
    66→
    67→          JSON output includes:
    68→          - success: boolean
    69→          - data: The result
    70→          - errors: Array of error objects (if any)
    71→        implements:
    72→          - '@cli-design'
    73→      - _ulid: 01KEZCJPHWB81SAWT4ZGCV75FC
    74→        slugs:
    75→          - cli-exit-codes
    76→        title: Semantic Exit Codes
    77→        type: requirement
    78→        status:
    79→          maturity: draft
    80→          implementation: not_started
    81→        description: |
    82→          Exit codes are semantic, not just 0/1:
    83→
    84→          - 0: Success
    85→          - 1: General error
    86→          - 2: Usage error (bad arguments)
    87→          - 3: Not found
    88→          - 4: Validation failed
    89→          - 5: Conflict (already exists, etc.)
    90→
    91→          Scripts can handle specific cases.
    92→        implements:
    93→          - '@cli-design'
