   101→          implementation: not_started
   102→        description: |
   103→          Features for agent/script usage:
   104→
   105→          - --json: Structured output
   106→          - --no-prompt: Never prompt (KSPEC_NO_PROMPT=1)
   107→          - --dry-run: Show what would happen
   108→          - --if-not-exists: Idempotent creation
   109→          - --quiet: Suppress non-essential output
   110→
   111→          Agents should be able to use kspec without interaction.
