   222→          Update a spec item's fields.
   223→
   224→          Options:
   225→          - --title <title>: Set item title
   226→          - --type <type>: Set item type
   227→          - --slug <slug>: Add a slug (can have multiple)
   228→          - --remove-slug <slug>: Remove a slug
   229→          - --priority <priority>: Set priority
   230→          - --tag <tag...>: Set tags (replaces existing)
   231→          - --description <desc>: Set description
   232→          - --status <status>: Set implementation status
   233→          - --maturity <maturity>: Set maturity level
   234→
   235→          Updates item in place and auto-commits to shadow branch.
