   761→        description: |-
   762→          kspec task patch <ref> [options]
   763→
   764→          Update task with JSON data.
   765→
   766→          Options:
   767→          - --data <json>: JSON object with fields to update
   768→          - --dry-run: Show what would change without writing
   769→          - --allow-unknown: Allow unknown fields (for extending format)
   770→
   771→          Accepts stdin if no --data provided.
   772→          Validates input against TaskInputSchema (strict by default).
   773→        acceptance_criteria:
