   780→            when: kspec task patch @my-task --data 'bad' runs
   781→            then: error with helpful message
   782→          - id: ac-3
   783→            given: JSON with unknown field
   784→            when: kspec task patch @my-task --data '{"unknown":true}' runs
   785→            then: error about unknown field (strict by default)
   786→          - id: ac-4
   787→            given: '--allow-unknown flag and unknown field'
   788→            when: kspec task patch @my-task --data '{"unknown":true}' --allow-unknown runs
   789→            then: field is written
