  1134→        title: kspec validate
  1135→        type: requirement
  1136→        status:
  1137→          maturity: draft
  1138→          implementation: not_started
  1139→        description: |-
  1140→          kspec validate [options]
  1141→
  1142→          Options:
  1143→          - --schema: Check schema conformance only
  1144→          - --refs: Check all @references resolve
  1145→          - --orphans: Find unreferenced items
  1146→          - --task-refs: Check task spec_refs resolve
  1147→          - --fix: Auto-fix issues where possible (invalid ULIDs, missing timestamps)
  1148→          - --strict: Treat warnings as errors
  1149→
  1150→          Default: All checks. Returns errors and warnings.
  1151→
  1152→          Auto-fix behavior (--fix):
  1153→          - Invalid ULIDs: Regenerates with valid ULID
  1154→          - Missing timestamps: Adds created field if neither created nor created_at exists
  1155→          - Excludes test fixtures from auto-fixing
  1156→          - Re-validates after fixes to confirm resolution
  1157→        implements:
  1158→          - '@validate-commands'
  1159→          - '@validation-modes'
