  1420→        description: |-
  1421→          kspec module add [options]
  1422→
  1423→          Create a new module YAML file.
  1424→
  1425→          Options:
  1426→          - --title <title>: Module title (required)
  1427→          - --slug <slug>: Module slug (required, becomes filename)
  1428→          - --description <desc>: Module description
  1429→          - --tag <tag...>: Tags for the module
  1430→
  1431→          Creates:
  1432→          1. modules/{slug}.yaml with module item
  1433→          2. Adds include to manifest
  1434→
  1435→          Example:
  1436→            kspec module add --title "Auth System" --slug auth
  1437→            # Creates modules/auth.yaml
  1438→            # Adds to manifest: includes: - modules/auth.yaml
  1439→        acceptance_criteria:
  1440→          - id: ac-1
  1441→            given: valid title and slug provided
  1442→            when: kspec module add --title 'Auth' --slug auth runs
  1443→            then: modules/auth.yaml created with module item structure
  1444→          - id: ac-2
  1445→            given: module created successfully
  1446→            when: module add completes
  1447→            then: manifest includes array has new entry for module file
  1448→          - id: ac-3
  1449→            given: slug 'auth' already exists in spec
  1450→            when: kspec module add --title 'Another' --slug auth runs
  1451→            then: error about duplicate slug
  1452→          - id: ac-4
  1453→            given: shadow branch is enabled
  1454→            when: module is created
  1455→            then: changes are auto-committed to shadow branch
  1456→  - _ulid: 01KF15N59C28PGQYJQNADVFHPA
