  1742→    slugs:
  1743→      - cli-ralph
  1744→    title: Ralph command - automated task loop
  1745→    type: feature
  1746→    tags: []
  1747→    description: >-
  1748→      Automated task loop using ACP protocol. Runs claude-code-acp agent in a loop to process kspec
  1749→      tasks autonomously with full event logging and streaming output.
  1750→    depends_on:
  1751→      - '@acp-client'
  1752→      - '@session-events'
  1753→    implements: []
  1754→    relates_to: []
  1755→    tests: []
  1756→    created: '2026-01-17T05:27:36.354Z'
  1757→    acceptance_criteria:
  1758→      - id: ac-1
  1759→        given: ready tasks exist
  1760→        when: kspec ralph is run with --max-loops N
  1761→        then: spawns ACP agent and runs up to N iterations
  1762→      - id: ac-2
  1763→        given: no ready tasks exist
  1764→        when: kspec ralph is run
  1765→        then: command exits with message indicating no ready tasks
  1766→      - id: ac-3
  1767→        given: a loop iteration starts
  1768→        when: agent picks and works on a task
  1769→        then: agent uses task start, task note, and task complete commands per working procedure
  1770→      - id: ac-4
  1771→        given: a loop iteration ends with work still in progress
  1772→        when: agent cannot complete the task in one iteration
  1773→        then: >-
  1774→          agent commits WIP, adds note documenting progress, and task remains in_progress for next
  1775→          iteration
  1776→      - id: ac-5
  1777→        given: a loop iteration completes (task done or WIP)
  1778→        when: there are uncommitted changes
  1779→        then: agent commits the changes with appropriate message
  1780→      - id: ac-6
  1781→        given: '--dry-run flag is provided'
  1782→        when: kspec ralph --dry-run is run
  1783→        then: shows the prompt that would be sent without executing agent
  1784→      - id: ac-7
  1785→        given: agent returns error during iteration
  1786→        when: the error occurs
  1787→        then: retry the iteration up to max-retries times before failing the loop
  1788→      - id: ac-8
  1789→        given: multiple consecutive iterations fail after all retries
  1790→        when: the failure count reaches max-failures threshold
  1791→        then: the loop exits early with an error message
  1792→      - id: ac-9
  1793→        given: '--adapter flag is provided'
  1794→        when: kspec ralph --adapter <id> is run
  1795→        then: uses specified adapter (default claude-code-acp)
  1796→      - id: ac-10
  1797→        given: session starts
  1798→        when: agent spawns
  1799→        then: creates new session with ULID and logs session.start event
  1800→      - id: ac-11
  1801→        given: agent streams updates
  1802→        when: updates arrive
  1803→        then: displays streaming output to CLI and logs to session events
  1804→      - id: ac-12
  1805→        given: prompt is sent
  1806→        when: iteration starts
  1807→        then: logs prompt.sent event with full prompt content
  1808→      - id: ac-13
  1809→        given: session ends
